  user_input {
    user_response: "i want to build a website, for a local bake store(Belaku Bakes), that showcases their menu(cakes and brownies) and allows the customer to get in touch with the store for custom orders by filing a form which then connect them directly through whatsapp with the store owner.  the store doesn\'t delivery it self, because they are a cloud kitchen, so they will be providing their adddress(can be shown on the map), and the user has to arrange the delivery themselves.\n\nthe owner only cooks the freshest ingredients, so the site should emphasize quality. we want a manimalistic site, which isn\'t very cluttered or overwellming and uses a warm, neutral color palette to feel welcoming and professional. i will provde pictures of the store symbol, name, and their menu, and I need you to implement an intuitive, easy-to-navigate layout.\n\nthis is their owners statement about their brand : \"Belaku Bakes, a cloud kitchen created from my passion for baking and bringing joy through desserts.\nAt Belaku Bakes, I craft a wide variety of sweet treats, including brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, cupcakes, customized cakes, and savory bakes. Every item is made with care, attention to detail, and a genuine love for creating something special.\nFor me, baking is more than just a profession\342\200\224it\'s what makes me happy. The greatest reward is seeing my customers and clients enjoy what I create. Knowing that my desserts can be a part of someone\'s celebration, special moment, or simple craving brings me immense satisfaction and motivates me to keep baking with passion every day.\nBelaku Bakes was built on the belief that good food creates happy memories. Whether it\'s a customized cake for a milestone event or a box of brownies to brighten someone\'s day, my goal is to make every order memorable and bring a smile to every customer\'s face.\"\n\ni am uploading a bunch of ducuments, with all the details of the store, the symbol, menu, contact info, etc, can be found there. you can also adopt the color schemes from there. although we want the website to be compatible with the industry standards, and look and feel like a luxury 2026 website\n with sleek animations and immersive, high-end transitions."
    items {
      text: "i want to build a website, for a local bake store(Belaku Bakes), that showcases their menu(cakes and brownies) and allows the customer to get in touch with the store for custom orders by filing a form which then connect them directly through whatsapp with the store owner.  the store doesn\'t delivery it self, because they are a cloud kitchen, so they will be providing their adddress(can be shown on the map), and the user has to arrange the delivery themselves.\n\nthe owner only cooks the freshest ingredients, so the site should emphasize quality. we want a manimalistic site, which isn\'t very cluttered or overwellming and uses a warm, neutral color palette to feel welcoming and professional. i will provde pictures of the store symbol, name, and their menu, and I need you to implement an intuitive, easy-to-navigate layout.\n\nthis is their owners statement about their brand : \"Belaku Bakes, a cloud kitchen created from my passion for baking and bringing joy through desserts.\nAt Belaku Bakes, I craft a wide variety of sweet treats, including brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, cupcakes, customized cakes, and savory bakes. Every item is made with care, attention to detail, and a genuine love for creating something special.\nFor me, baking is more than just a profession\342\200\224it\'s what makes me happy. The greatest reward is seeing my customers and clients enjoy what I create. Knowing that my desserts can be a part of someone\'s celebration, special moment, or simple craving brings me immense satisfaction and motivates me to keep baking with passion every day.\nBelaku Bakes was built on the belief that good food creates happy memories. Whether it\'s a customized cake for a milestone event or a box of brownies to brighten someone\'s day, my goal is to make every order memorable and bring a smile to every customer\'s face.\"\n\ni am uploading a bunch of ducuments, with all the details of the store, the symbol, menu, contact info, etc, can be found there. you can also adopt the color schemes from there. although we want the website to be compatible with the industry standards, and look and feel like a luxury 2026 website\n with sleek animations and immersive, high-end transitions."
    }
  }
}
