  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Order Form Concept**\n\nOkay, I\'m focusing on the `OrderForm.tsx` component. The key is crafting a custom order planner that auto-generates a luxury text message for the owner, pre-formatted and ready to go. The link will directly open WhatsApp, pre-populated with the owner\'s number.\n\n\n**Defining Order Form Fields**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the form\'s structure, thinking about the necessary fields. I\'m prioritizing user experience, so I\'m thinking of name, contact number, and bake type as the core elements. I\'m including flavor, weight/quantity, \"writing on cake\" (conditional), eggless option, pickup date/time, and special instructions. I\'m also planning the WhatsApp flow: validation, a structured text template ready for the WhatsApp app, opening WhatsApp directly.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/OrderForm.tsx` using the `create_file` tool to assemble the custom order request center. The component features direct state synchronization, a live real-time formatted text message preview pane, premium input groups, eggless indicator options, validation styling, and an elegant trigger action that instantly initiates a deep-link redirect to the bake store owner on WhatsApp."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 96197540
    }
  }
