          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "    text: \"Belaku Bakes crafted a gorgeous 2-tier lavender honey bespoke cake for my mother\'s milestone birthday. Not only was it an absolute work of modern botanical art, but the taste was exceptionally balanced\342\200\224rich and moist without being overwhelming or overly sweet. Truly Bangalore\'s best cloud kitchen gem!\","
