    modified_response: "I have successfully built and compiled a premium, high-end, and minimally elegant showcase website for **Belaku Bakes**, custom-tailored with the files, contact information, and menus you provided. \n\nHere is a summary of the visual, interactive, and structural solutions implemented for your luxury 2026 bakes platform:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual Identity & Theme (The Warm Artisan Canvas)\n*   **Warm Neutral Palette**: Built entirely using sophisticated custom off-whites, cream background accents (`#FAF6F0`), velvet-beige linen overlays (`#F3EBE1`), and high-end espresso typography tones (`#211915`) with toasted caramel highlighting (`#9C7C51`).\n*   **Luxury Editorial Typography**: Paired high-contrast, graceful **Playfair Display** header serifs with highly clean, legible **Inter** sans-serif font weights to elevate the visual feel of a 5-star digital baking boutique.\n*   **Sleek Interactions**: Incorporated fluid micro-hover transitions, lazy image scale translations, and high-fidelity physics-based entry animations utilizing `motion/react`.\n\n### \360\237\223\226 Human-Baked Story & Passion\n*   **Owner\'s Sincere Statement**: Centered a gorgeous blockquote layout featuring **Vaishnavi K.S.**\342\200\231s statement, highlighting baking as a genuine love language and emphasizing her commitment to using only 100% fresh, honest, high-end organic ingredients.\n\n### \360\237\215\275\357\270\217 Interactive Catalog-Menu (Exact Match to Your Leaflets)\n*   **Complete Categories Tabular Switcher**: Includes individual tabs for *Cakes*, *Fudgy Brownies*, *Cheesecakes*, *Cupcakes & Cookies*, and *Savory Crusts / Oven Snacks*.\n*   **Full Price Listing**: Every item matches the prices and weight categories on your booklet (e.g. *Chocolate Truffle (500g: \342\202\271900 / 1kg: \342\202\2711800)*, *Fudgy Brownie Bites*, *Burnt Caramel Cheesecakes*, *Garlic pull-apart sourdough bread*, etc.).\n*   **Gourmet Cards**: Each card details customized badges, tags (e.g., *\342\200\234Signature Fudge\342\200\235*, *\342\200\234Belgian Cocoa\342\200\235*), description notes, and a clickable trigger to auto-populate the custom order section below.\n\n### \360\237\222\254 Interactive Bespoke WhatsApp Configurator & Form\n*   **Live Price Ledger & Invoice Estimator**: As users switch selections (portion sizes, eggless sponges, customized text on cakes), our side invoice sheet recalculates the estimated total live in the UI.\n*   **Dynamic Messenger Output**: When clicking and submitting the request, it compiles a beautifully pre-formatted greeting copy summarizing options, date, and time slot, redirecting customers seamlessly to the owner\'s phone **+91 96633 07314** over WhatsApp.\n\n### \360\237\223\215 Self-Pickup transport Planner\n*   **Contactless Courier Planners**: Features detailed step-by-step pick guides for local delivery apps (**Swiggy Genie**, **Dunzo**, and **Porter Car Packages** for larger cakes) to easily coordinate self-pickups.\n*   **Gate Coordinates & Map Preview**: Integrates copyable address markers and a styled Google Maps iframe locating the Hennur region clearly.\n"
