    summary: "To find an Unsplash cheesecake photo ID, you can browse cheesecake photos on Unsplash and then locate the ID within the photo\'s URL.\n\nHere\'s how to do it:\n1.  Go to Unsplash.com and search for \"cheesecake\"[1][2][3][4].\n2.  Click on any cheesecake photo that interests you.\n3.  Once you are on the individual photo page, the photo ID will be part of the URL in your browser\'s address bar[5][6]. For example, in a URL like `https://unsplash.com/photos/nDV6ahWLvEg`, `nDV6ahWLvEg` is the photo ID[6].\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1VJ9ElODkF3zYKWWWpt-49cgI0z57JY8nQnSb_HpDkBiY0LPV8aHoG-SV0Dz7IyMTMaQLhu4t1ZHPSTwbWd7B1oX8vUFhNBNocBaQRko7wmk00fPeERHL9iuksxVQmX1MKPx537mPe34=)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGBxd5lqFOCdLu_PVICAZwE7DFLiaEJYFQuTBJWQvzoPpN5p27KLn7a73FR_HOBMX70FCZ9R9W49tNdsxZiVJc9oYBYYZj2uId1yY_JLCy5sn1ljSp4dYMiWsawoIVl2fCfz0s=)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEtBQOR7sL7xlms7zUQnkpgnyUncyziYa6Cf2rUxUIuppOYgTD-kwSEI4kkLeG080IXDk9N9Uf_1osp8PAGNohj3o5ap16dhYGxARHCkr_BgzU9g5uMpd9mZap3fa92EygQrXq)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUBHj_EfI9534n6WcwXCOKX9FWTi2xo3nNP_QY_nfopH9StT3u-ihiiDtzntA1evQOCENXkSS3_yK4SsHqPHQuZ7J3L53nPHReoAW23kI_2eterhtBlBVFvG0EN-IYHi4xDzkT3W4ZtGJY)\n[5] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTTBbRALtkz3VMGHrb1rBSycNUfUAIgWbdc9bxrLKDDor854KKvpOJXUlEvdxzvbib_UHyfJ59C8NHBr76X7ozJF7QHhq7bo1thzM-Rt3HVgYCYycIj1X77vdqT_ceYvVok-3zt8l3ZoK-FqSHduuL-L9cgW84DAxiNJWYAD2jlAhw93gBOZ3JMLW0SN8aPw==)\n[6] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETVo6kFt_Aq6rJTGYK1vg3eQEX0JrqdtSh0XKXHre41v_LOBRPft7ZULENIbr6ezco-2byBdbaAtsRZR8zQijmQCP7MNj1TeyrnGrDGyJbuvPG3TPzF13G2CAEcq5yvPMVvI24Qz_N4DF1Q9tODVe5LVyfr2MzvYGNLsYXuvMOnbe