    summary: "To find Unsplash photo IDs for bakery items such as cakes, brownies, cookies, cheesecakes, and savory pastries, you generally need to visit the Unsplash website and locate specific images. Photo IDs are typically part of the image\'s URL.\n\nHere is an example of an Unsplash photo ID found for a cheesecake image, and guidance on how to locate others:\n\n**Cheesecakes**\n*   **l0gPYC2wXxw**[1] (This ID is associated with a cheesecake image that was historically available on Unsplash and is referenced on Wikimedia Commons).\n\nWhile direct photo IDs are not always presented in search result snippets, Unsplash organizes images by categories and keywords. To find specific photo IDs for other items, you can follow these steps:\n\n1.  **Search on Unsplash.com**: Go to Unsplash.com and use the search bar to look for terms like \"bakery cakes,\" \"brownies,\" \"cookies,\" \"cheesecakes,\" or \"savory pastries.\"\n2.  **Select an Image**: Click on an image you like from the search results.\n3.  **Extract the ID from the URL**: Once on the individual image\'s page, the photo ID will be a unique alphanumeric string in the URL. For example, in a URL like `https://unsplash.com/photos/PHOTO_ID`, \"PHOTO_ID\" is the image\'s unique identifier.\n\nMany collections and pages with relevant images exist on Unsplash that can lead you to specific photo IDs:\n*   Over 750 \"Bakery\" pictures are available on Unsplash[2].\n*   There are over 500 \"Cake\" pictures and 350 \"Cakes\" pictures[3][4].\n*   \"Brownies\" and \"Chocolate Brownies\" collections also contain numerous images[5][6][7][8]. For instance, a \"Brownies in close-up photography\" image is available[9].\n*   Collections for \"Cookies,\" \"Baking Cookies,\" \"Homemade Cookies,\" \"Eating Cookies,\" and \"Chocolate Cookie\" provide a wide selection[10][11][12][13][14].\n*   \"Cheesecake,\" \"Cheesecakes,\" \"Cheesecake Slice,\" \"Blueberry Cheesecake,\" and \"Basque Cheesecake\" collections offer many options[15][16][17][18][19]. Specific examples include a \"Cheesecake with pink toppings\"[20], a \"Fresh berry cheesecake\"[21], and a \"piece of cheesecake with a cherry on top\"[22].\n*   For \"Savory Pastries,\" you can find images such as \"Savory pastry with fresh vegetables and dips\"[23], \"Savory pastries with meat toppings\"[24], and various \"Savory tart\" images[25][26][27]. Additionally, general \"Pastries\" and \"French Pastry\" collections are available[28][29][30].\n\nSources:\n[1] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGADqDNlokyWoN8N-N3M4Wi1s-wglowshyXa_lLLyWKn7Dkz3L0qRvtGB58KKiWW3xTK1F4u39UvT2qR51esrmv86mxebfBirXo68zi0QHglM-hTo6WmpwC0mKmfub52hKbFPPdqidMAVYAcJ2NgPmETB2OIeezF5JXu_fhPg==)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzzPEfMAUOQKfaL0mGxASgDxlz39Z-5M5QDscF1hFMRSSRHIBxuwi4whsPo_tEvs2KhHAc1kVE7U3qIk6BhzRC0kCLYDSafwN-p3_nIe-SZgx9jRG6S2U5h1eAEwvQ0w==)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFze27V_HoS0diCe_oSxVXvSobaMmg8mKvZlUahgTR0HefBuPcv3eVtUp4RlvE66GxKP1DRQE9NMntSOpIvRFdQ7k-5glxj0dEMZMbSV01xCC7ilrlx7SWUUvOBRS8=)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEI0o3IQZvondwvlHcs-69FC_Zc5bWPbS8yBFhhKcQfk8MZ9VVwSrRGbT6qfRQb5CqcpNtSftUuBOCOb6GnLov0HLVGPULPuscyE7m1q3hhcEGdZ44tKTGtjXKd6XfF)\n[5] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFlRA1oKpkEUOAfENqsSZ6qA0os9rOfbWexacZVlPKXumBaApGSMcK0TMrMb_1MmfKqKfr7z4_tJigEjQlA9YgzqyZuStoX1QxewvdNfHymVnOYQKptQXL3ll3_dN9HRnwn)\n[6] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZdftiM5GXIFMycr7yIqDmW5l-3jT-2ROjSPIGggighP6dixPunMH1bmIn_4-epW5Qat3a-BVntzG8HlGgvogoMqjVms1dFXUVcyu87htxYFf1Wc05rkVwiTWV7qjm3RY=)\n[7] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoqvh4I8MFzToixIGTQOE9gteyMFphUxZo_R0zBNSQima1LWAgxRhxyMaNWsWZxW