    summary: "Unsplash offers a wide variety of free, high-resolution images of chocolate cakes. There are over 750 pictures available for download, suitable for commercial use with no attribution required[1].\n\nSome examples of chocolate cake images found on Unsplash include:\n*   A chocolate cake with chocolate toppings[2].\n*   A chocolate cake on white paper[3].\n*   A chocolate cake with berries on top[4].\n*   Images featuring chocolate cakes with a slice cut out, or with chocolate syrup[5].\n\nNotable photographers who have contributed chocolate cake images include Olimpia Davies, Stephen Wheeler, American Heritage Chocolate, and Jacob Thomas[1][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEpYUMGhoMXIJnkG_Qp1C1T4OuhXsJwM40VJZH0GYayo-joFevJ1yLHYzMHwIVQXSeaoVjhvaPKq-7AdEtFtgQXBwLwiY7pKTUDoKMxHB1Ev4fXP5O1ggE60d0NiW9OD0WnS9sfdcwq)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlQa6N8U9CaexS_8cTXeXT2tl6lGkQFm-dUbidfK8CVMXU6oci3DKizVhjCsy7-l8qxATduDrNXAMHK-_MZJKONUasPlZtVI7cjf7nwfrNgg7X8vwx8YkL49zSXeixaebRwPZw6MY9xwpL659t2EdSD8NV-DPrGJYQqHRYIdTmk9kTvQBoWJw5Lw==)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHVAGsi2sAsHIeNzdZkPBbsgk_oUH7CUqYP_H_ba5RrrtNcQUgltrfwY4Bz65bdPSVrZqWk_MAyPSwB8tUYtyiQbg4LywEbXCx-7k493pWwFKN5m9vWijbDibxD6JFcoFuiImoI7o0ePPdqDgbGd2lht3kolv957yCXE27BP78vjQ==)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQESN6TMa8gE6oXb4_b13ppc5c5Kvp9FY3DP4ZwQBJENPxrvc2nJNSo-nLzdD2_xONkt_oyLha0itx7GeNK-TmWhbhugaQdh-EPONZubbn9Hi5xHMMwm8SsBDQK103M9NMOlzHWReqluRwx4PaSYrw8N5lsryb4D6bAr88fFGB6fEOMfoiN9ofuAIT_0Zu0=)\n[5] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8M3P8wjuYb9pEjMzonaiqTT--y7MvVsKOFjm4CUP08oRUAEmePPVtJZLKC6YwhP0sJWzCdXgriwsaLczvsPVqtCz-MhD8Dl-vNGOGVYtHVZeteDw975kOpoMKv5j60knJ-85EIgkvnQ==)"
