    summary: "To find photos on Unsplash related to \"food,\" \"dessert,\" \"cake,\" \"cookie,\" \"brownie,\" and \"savory,\" you can use the search bar on the Unsplash website[1][2]. Simply type your desired keywords into the search bar, and Unsplash will display relevant images[1].\n\nFor instance, you can search for:\n*   \"food\"[3]\n*   \"dessert\"[4][5]\n*   \"cake\"[6]\n*   \"cookie\" (often found under \"baked goods\"[7])\n*   \"brownie\" (can be found by searching \"dessert\" or \"baked goods\"[5][7])\n*   \"savory\" (search for specific savory dishes or general \"food\")\n\nRegarding \"photoid,\" Unsplash\'s primary website search does not support searching for individual photos directly by a photo ID or filename[8]. However, if you are a developer using the Unsplash API, you can access a specific photo by its unique ID[9][10].\n\nAlternatively, Unsplash offers a \"Visual Search\" tool where you can upload an image or provide an image URL to find visually similar photos[11][12][2]. This can be useful if you have an example image of the type of food or dessert you are looking for.\n\nSources:\n[1] [cuny.edu](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKGP1QBUSSH0fJXPqzo6SSjqaJaYIYjZEXt7Mu3mU-_berZTKSmBPSmG0rYhf6Mq30Hr3czr00r1kdtMRUJ9Kb0bLa87s4QPS4Zm2iwgK5R95OJ3FlPP4d7p1QiCURWeB5RLMN1Gbai7DFlt0qKBpnb1ZLjZNBx8xlUfRtK47dUmKGTZxoxmHiRl21zacw-If4)\n[2] [writingcooperative.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG8Oyvq4FLT2iNxwj64CUIvZWqycmh4ll3XAvJFGqV9zfzfFzvi0qJH7ung53G9iqKsrdnkJ18QvoGhOPXP3VZwqNeUFfZDnCybhnN_g1sdK96NWOEykHRgeNOwd5jVvxdeexXeYBBNjgMfjznNmdvqZGma-X8KcHeBd8rRAcIkQwe_uGKEJbLm-rmwZnEBiFFvUuk4IUJ9x7i6DSGNKz6X4OunbnKukF4D)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHO72GzLr5Xj-3nSLWvpktHPJyy0_7h7fANTZk_PgK0y7XvrACJQce1CtGn5zTRhMn_ynIDMiGFg3Dbz5kuWeurFGhj0dSVjCDG3avh3iPVZFnRjTdrTW9zgq2lcEA=)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.