    summary: "Unsplash features a variety of free-to-use garlic bread images. Users can find numerous pictures of garlic bread, including close-ups of slices, garlic bread with herbs and cheese, and different preparations of the dish[1][2][3]. While some images on Unsplash might include the term \"photo\" in their descriptions or titles, the use of a negative keyword like \"photo-\" in a search query aims to filter out such results, directing users towards images where \"photo-\" is not explicitly part of the metadata[4]. For example, images titled \"Garlic bread by Madara Moroza\" or \"Garlic Slices by Waldemar Brandt Zevn\" are available[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [lifediethealth.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlCv0IR8KaTqswxALhKRaIevyhkle2WJeAHdKY0XbnOmbSr2lpsSquhzyYKINdFqqc7B2S5NXXN4tJOjNVb3b4sOiEeNUtRRPQ7Ku1ZHyuX5O22dPifMdE9Io91e5xlpq_SC4bxN4HJuKLVBxecz_tE0L54sBcCLQiPSIrleeuNi8iz8LPsn_z7DiSyMPs1vAgc5GX2vcIIpxH9fVJnrdIKVZp)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEjvSs0ALZHFBcVPtx35Pp91YxktioBBlziP6iVxftYxfkaqVDAG9H8KMywoiMHkl0UYHW4qxIOUIrtNsnr-092g1LzHvkvNbwin42Dd3P1u_P_X0rjo_HM5idQtpystYkRUqii)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9UjJbhh0zRkBug-lK2_l3w_9Z70T1H9bhMWvzmSNWzMJvyzGzjLbIBnf7F84WirpfZ_cgT_3xRCuFaGi2rKNecUyHtLLA0tSHjl1ombKMwTy4AuDfFMQtL7Gqd8AO6lhTXZsT8ql0gUvVqV-4Lx6BU1GR3ZVLLxKHwGON4Hm8O80MTstnTzfRaZwnPQkqYw==)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFiMv7QDBRw7-Y9m-SDy4yxex3wyrVFt7ZWUO280bfCgY74aBzPBlzabePNZ7EZP4VcX4QXl34dsgWeRPidt9iHqIelQDjke327LAchoXJCzYOvR1u5BbCI5yPnpLLVcQo0QxvD02jJZo7e-eFIEA==)"
