    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzni4PTobKJ6rP-cfVCeOxxAJKZ6haf7SZ50_s80yKW68bL3nuWRvKX8P8QDWBIVdBGeUpsVYwHDXoVtQM4o1CVpc_pjFkKvx3G2dAlTXfl8kjJSrkErkz7ZMfwXmRfu5C-OlmL4IiQZAByAI="
      title: "wikipedia.org"
    }
    summary: "Here\'s a summary of information regarding garlic bread, savory bread, bread pizza, and buns:\n\n**Garlic Bread**\nGarlic bread, also known as garlic toast, is typically made from bread, often a baguette, sourdough, or ciabatta, topped with garlic and usually olive oil or butter, and sometimes herbs like oregano, chives, or parsley.[1] It is then grilled or baked until toasted.[1] This popular Italian-American side dish originated from bruschetta, an Italian dish of toasted bread rubbed with raw garlic and drizzled with olive oil.[1][2] Common variations include cheesy garlic bread, garlic knots, and garlic bread pizza.[1]\n\n**Savory Bread**\nSavory breads are a broad category of breads that are not sweet and often feature ingredients like herbs, cheese, vegetables, or spices. Examples include focaccia (often with rosemary and garlic or sun-dried tomato and caramelized onion), olive bread, Parmesan-herb popovers, cheddar and spring onion soda bread, and cheesy zucchini bread.[3][4][5] Other savory options can include Indian fry bread, beer bread, jalape\303\261o bacon cheddar bread, and various seasoned flatbreads like naan or pita.[4][6]\n\n**Bread Pizza**\nBread pizza offers a quick and easy way to make pizza using slices of bread as the base.[7] It involves spreading pizza sauce, layering toppings such as onions, bell peppers, tomatoes, and cheese, and then baking or grilling until the cheese melts and the bread is toasted.[8][7][9] French bread pizza is a variation where French bread is brushed with garlic butter, toasted, topped with pizza ingredients, and then baked again.[10] This method can prevent the bread from becoming soggy.[10]\n\n**Buns**\nBuns are a versatile type of bread roll, with numerous varieties often categorized by their use or ingredients. Common types include:\n*   **Burger Buns:** Soft, often slightly sweet, and sometimes topped with sesame seeds.[11][12][13][14] Brioche buns, known for their buttery, soft texture and sweetness, are a popular choice for gourmet burgers.[11][13][14] Potato buns offer a subtly sweet and sturdy base, while milk buns are noted for their distinct milky taste and soft interior with a slightly crispier exterior.[11][13][14]\n*   **Hot Dog Buns:** Elongated and soft, designed to hold sausages and condiments.[11][12]\n*   **Dinner Rolls:** Smaller rolls often served with meals.[11][15]\n*   **Sweet Buns:** Such as cinnamon buns, fruit buns (infused with dried fruits and spices), and honey buns.[11][12][15]\n*   **Other Varieties:** Include Kaiser rolls, brioche buns, ciabatta buns, pretzel buns, sesame seed buns, and potato buns.[11] Some Asian varieties include lotus seed buns and barbecue pork buns, often prepared by steaming.[15]\n\nSources:\n[1] [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFj8gXAKSeIYeqeIpT8svgc0g58Vu7qMv5useB4hD5_a688PR0rghe49fZNjqUqjdj3E8fPFaY2QCwSNI_yOWshgg4HWKyzj3xsPRIUMzyD9PL9AJcCdsu41ZwilvfoVKw04oUCXg==)\n[2] [panlasangpinoy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETqGAA6anKbVhhrgMihZkUuchvNAQlwHvJjB8p-KRmx-D5F07Rrg-XbynePc1S7ALWzLeXmYxXpEOoBn_9IAR_o3xYC2NUmcVVtrIRcNr9nIoaa0BqNjYi_M04i-ngWlFgUD_4hoh9wW8V)\n[3] [surlatable.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtaV7SyarX3EfIMfN2u0EMuNLrqJNr_r2C8Qr7XfwQMi13zyQz-xPv54Cv8YeM2gAINuluVfJ7WbLvrxTUBcEIRyc8NaK6TFXts5lzZ-6E2pc0qXdRlajF-Nt9Rk6lBXk73w1-uZTXGyqnXVt7hjLaMmqV7aJw)\n[4] [forksoverknives.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvbnpvvA_5zO5uANl-ztWMglZUD9vDg-JUWRS63LRi1hTD56o6Lh1NLLFc19nwW-q_QSJNNERRRdR3U9pg6ptETAvzmM0OPiVMhifV8qd7Q2cMgENAOn2wExf4KFOkoKVzlwgeu0kO_yghRFRkrcdPdFWwvsM-2OdVVrPYMDVQLhMJl9CWDxT5BHAQdiNmF9PxWrn7ylX52_3AOURuqmx18eU=)\n[5] [binkysculinarycarnival.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFEEWzxUjedzMZ6Fm5DUS6yaLW2QGiJKF4scgd_hr-CHfY6cF2YFSDdHmQWa_wHfkY7Ij8qHWvPANevXYm7gjJJOLT2Y2X4j5HtZsYj