    summary: "The search on Unsplash for \"garlic bread OR savory bread OR pizza bread OR buns OR puff pastry photo\" yielded several results showcasing various types of these bread products.\n\nFor **garlic bread**, results include recipes for cheesy garlic bread made with puff pastry, as well as pull-apart garlic bread, often featuring mozzarella and served with pizza sauce[1][2]. There are also sweet-and-savory garlic bread rolls, which incorporate a cream cheese filling and a garlic-infused dip[3].\n\nRegarding **puff pastry**, it is utilized in recipes for cheesy garlic bread and roasted garlic puff pastry flatbread, often topped with cheeses like mozzarella and gorgonzola, and herbs such as rosemary and thyme[1][4].\n\n**Pizza bread** appears in the search results as royalty-free images, depicting freshly baked garlic pizza bread with cheese and herbs, and even a \"happy pizza character holding garlic bread\"[5]. Garlic focaccia bread is also mentioned as a type of flat garlic bread with olive oil and herbs[5].\n\nWhile direct photos of \"savory bread\" or \"buns\" as distinct categories weren\'t explicitly detailed as separate Unsplash image results, the descriptions of garlic bread, pizza bread, and puff pastry dishes often fall under the \"savory bread\" umbrella, and some garlic bread preparations involve rolls, which are a type of bun[3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [averiecooks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFGy1d2YqwZ3m_DU-pEGtFO7sdD1hgCqFdZ4fefJB1JK06h3w9VoepNKU6OFdQTWZoBP-PEDKVNwRkgj2EHpoArLShfkGUPg-jYnWg2F_j9vnU8BiSz_B9sJ2LdPSLEdyE9oaIcsxad2Z1HgELX2VjfX-k_X5-MYg==)\n[2] [breadboozebacon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEU2yZ3MDH7MAXsgtPbMqda1RlvugeqpMsk2ibyrwxRxiDL9U1EMtqE4MPZdIHrMrIrwxgrrVf6NS6mKL4vvCSf3jyEJuKUDpNtjLBvgKDNWI-N2rjjHQ7Lso6owOkyE-h_gwIESB7ssZ443GlGdKvaOUTrpaUf)\n[3] [gardenandgun.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFye7rYjFny0B0XoUXv7srm8gaxDFZHMIuYORcfy9TqRZG24sUBeshnRNlxRjQSuISPdhqdhdaxndCXoRoDD7kS7b_xpkogL-s8zVLIRweOfU-oljPko0V4fGVHqbTINsgGed3ZUFHb6qldjq2esrLjN9tEDTCqYclL6k9VqezCpP0UTyN5gEc8S2zX)\n[4] [motherthyme.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5NFvNIvkzEV2bidaip7BHfaHZp3jccrK9cGVc0XKGcOM0PniTsdNLUS1SAyDssHKZs4_nV-PqWTveOR18KbYE_C8qVJIUAIMpelPtXCuWSF34lsql7K_fTvkL6JqLFxsZK58CetRFRM15M2qRoHlU_reb1vsqNCK6vpucJb-u8lRvrK-Jam2d)\n[5] [shutterstock.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTOaZx4nLd2g9RfTygVnwdVaMMY4Ouu3SZOkNwcZxkxjIrqfYxsWMwH3li4FtIL3gna8yx0RM9_sOfGEaI_mIPkqLu1rTw9TOdyP23pW4vIbQ7UelDxmBo3ORQ8JNlD2WKNyZ618hbS6hd1BHAVFQKMg==)"
