    summary: "Unsplash hosts a wide variety of free-to-use images related to \"bread,\" \"buns,\" \"pastry,\" \"flour,\" and \"cake,\" with many of these images having URLs that include the \"images.unsplash.com/photo-1\" prefix.\n\nFor \"flour,\" Unsplash offers over 100 free images, including those depicting wheat flour and flour used in baking[1][2][3][4][5]. Similarly, \"buns\" has over 100 free images available, featuring various types like hot cross buns and burger buns, with examples of images showing buns on a table or tray[6][7][8][9][10].\n\nRegarding \"pastry,\" Unsplash provides over 500 high-definition pictures, including French pastry and puff pastry, as well as images of pastry shops[11][12][13][14][15]. There are also more than 500 \"bread\" pictures, encompassing sliced bread, eating bread, and bread rolls[16][17][18][19][20][9].\n\nFor \"cake,\" Unsplash features numerous images, including birthday cakes, chocolate cakes, vanilla cakes, simple cakes, and pictures of people eating cake[21][22][23][24][25].\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhiELc-VVoPV6Ik3M8mZP81LGSxe3O5jpWqWMDzsTS0WqkhQ8jfrVMkNs0L1ulpoWEFSM-Gu2iG5ymppBB0rxjOKjbS5sdRtccz7Aa2hlYEgYyIaTcqSjiOs9Fs0s_)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEbDHUwxV2aHEZiCkdZC40ExBD0WvymRxLCTBovaSmbwaGWLL0EsirolycrFCsHqcAiP17CooH9eXRbEuPwD5NNOVmXAkuwOUpaf5kmDfPzbU-2Kr5qGByPznkR-UM9WLVu-krB)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHx-Kz1BvVprKTyMSYjD7XC56CcHJATjmhgG3ZCxHwJ867yxMtsR67lQEtG9frVD_Iy14Fnw2mCS3Lakwc999HyczBJQc5r3k77mxbBlrtRPhwq47OEqf5534QU4X_GLA==)\n[4] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGRZzU5bYVHBzAqnv5jPvfexxa2WPaLN_tiLY_4m6PcWhWJaER6u0P4hSDpGumDzw3nKMvQM62gYFUusTumdji-qZ7ElD0kbYMFUSUPvjCSCjBfIk8ObLl8HYDEUk3vgLlQJyj6Lw==)\n[5] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.c