e cookies to `photo-1499636136210-6f4ee915583e` because this is just a beautiful pile of crumbly cookies!\nI\'m also working on finding a new savory bakery image.\n\n\n**Choosing Savory Bread Imagery**\n\nI\'ve selected `photo-1544982503-9f984c14501a` for garlic bread! It\'s a fantastic image of artisan garlic bread with rosemary and sea salt. It feels like a perfect fit, I\'m confident about that. I also reviewed `photo-1608039829572-78524f79c4c7`, but the former is superior. I am now working on a multi-file replace to professionally format all image paths in the directory, and re-checking the About page image.\n\n\n"
