    summary: "I couldn\'t find specific photo IDs directly listed in the search results from Unsplash.com. When searching for images on stock photography websites like Unsplash, photo IDs are typically found on the individual image\'s page or within its URL once you navigate to the site.\n\nHowever, the search did indicate numerous images related to \"savory pastry\", \"savory snacks\", and \"garlic bread\" on various stock photo platforms:\n\n*   Dreamstime offers over 2,400 stock photos for \"pastry savory snacks\"[1] and \"savory pastry snacks\"[2].\n*   iStock has over 139,000 \"Savory Pastry\" stock photos, pictures, and royalty-free images[3].\n*   Shutterstock provides over 129,800 royalty-free \"Savory Bread\" stock photos, vectors, and illustrations[4].\n*   Magnific also offers free and premium savory images, including \"homemade tasty bread with garlic, cheese and herbs\" and \"floating focaccia bread\"[5].\n\nTo obtain the specific photo IDs from Unsplash.com, you would need to visit Unsplash directly and search for \"savory pastry\", \"savory snacks\", or \"garlic bread\". The photo ID is usually part of the image\'s URL or can be found on the image\'s dedicated page on the Unsplash website.\n\nSources:\n[1] [dreamstime.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF85nj8KOs1lCaTfMGF1quho_8H8aQfWxKg1VWDI-UH0YJWFljJnicrI74wycPWGcPIhBh7oqXRHNj0GcLTuAqcdUdSZpSc4BX93SrQl9xUFVSzkJTnB3bshXHIAM8aRJw0RmM6XymRJuonTdNA6TuknlNcxb7hkj1b4QQh)\n[2] [dreamstime.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8Eb2XdkhSOeVRucYIasT_vApvZhbJH5bEnqU1pR9CzcTnh40Eso0sq21jznbZ00WqDvBx7L1Dh-ebwTIJsmIxTNM5QIXPmM0caErhzAFTRYTREeTnXHJXVIRVgqvIUae-74tv1SYloVMlnGfT6rThU_8L_ikexrHwTnjh)\n[3] [istockphoto.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhsvMmLXLCpE0tp_rHjpIjHZk0yMGuiQjlTIUFX4IF9wynAnRPuB9jGtpzmUv2XlTdlVh40RV8XtlIauhkq3YTPoL9ocdDK_5rwnioZEIiTsd5VcVCCbk_ouRHIf2i-lggdl8YoNlykb7v)\n[4] [shut