    summary: "Unsplash.com/photos offers a wide array of images related to \"garlic bread,\" \"savory,\" \"pastry,\" and \"baking.\"\n\nFor **garlic bread**, users can find numerous pictures, including detailed shots like \"Garlic bread with herbs and cheese on a plate\"[1][2][3]. The platform also features collections for \"Puff Pastry Cheesy Garlic Bread\"[4].\n\nUnder the **savory** category, Unsplash provides images such as \"A savory pie with creamy sauce and fresh greens\"[5] and \"Savory pastry with fresh vegetables and dips\"[6], in addition to a general collection of savory pictures[7].\n\n**Pastry** enthusiasts can explore extensive selections, including general \"Pastries Pictures\"[8], images from \"Pastry Shop Pictures\"[9], and specific themes like \"Coffee And Pastry Pictures\"[10] and \"Puff Pastry Pictures\"[11]. Images featuring \"Pastry Chef\" are also available[12].\n\nRegarding **baking**, Unsplash hosts a rich collection of images[13], encompassing \"Home Baking Pictures\"[14], \"Bake Pictures\"[15], \"Baked Good Pictures\"[16], and \"Bakery Pictures\"[17].\n\nSources:\n[1] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGF89x3inMqzD5I0LQpiQDSI08P_IUdCM5UZ-6TJY7_wX9wEE8AIRYj7pYsdOo3JE0oLexslW_wbYUm3ReQbJys8YzQd10S5wWEc4M6tiSlOHj2GpeFS35xvdiTDlNoe6RcnvzmQwKv61e1wrLqAGExuWdZI9o0jN11WMyWfGXvy0dh5rSTTzuefWSH6DcAfdg=)\n[2] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJ_qEF2RypACdb80bp_wQU4E0JRuCFSk-y7_BcfB6GgIftOjVW0Fa3YaffE5fXqsdsQRd2FdcX2j0BeYdxfzFD2uMT2iRjPMoMCHju6nnxMEW0BvlsOIAc3trrJ66nwjqaZhAeqw==)\n[3] [unsplash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHcNdDSO5sQEtj8dkT1-nfK5hvtYHkWKDA2lRINWihihpI8PkF6FnA7vzp2R781NP-IsO9Fr8oZlfQFFr021ciwy9T6iea-5_nhSPDNgK1mMpiZWBba0vCzMqE0YQwt19m6uOpMwaWlxXJECHGez1Q=)\n[4] [averiecooks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHx9QoSDqsvntiKFGSL1wmGY0BMe8GKgSIJTjRmVtNZ1Ku