    summary: "A search for \"korean garlic\" OR \"garlic bread\" OR \"garlic buns\" OR \"cream cheese buns\" OR \"korean bread\" OR \"korean cheese\" OR \"baked buns\" on Unsplash.com with `inurl:photos` did not directly yield image results from Unsplash in the provided snippets. Instead, the results focused on recipes and descriptions of various garlic bread and Korean cream cheese garlic bread dishes from food blogs and recipe websites.\n\nThe search findings include:\n*   Recipes for Korean Cream Cheese Garlic Bread, often using soft dinner rolls or Hawaiian rolls, filled with a sweet cream cheese mixture and dipped in a garlic butter sauce containing ingredients like sweetened condensed milk, heavy cream, minced garlic, and parsley[1][2].\n*   Descriptions of making garlic bread with Hawaiian rolls, involving cutting an \"X\" into the rolls, pouring garlic butter over them, and baking until golden[3].\n*   Instructions for making \"Cheese and Garlic Crack Bread\" (pull-apart bread) which involves cutting a loaf of bread diagonally, drizzling with garlic butter, and stuffing with cheese before baking[4].\n*   A classic garlic bread recipe using French bread, butter, Parmesan, garlic, and parsley[5].\n\nWhile these results provide detailed information on the preparation and ingredients of the requested food items, direct links to image collections on Unsplash.com were not present in the search snippets.\n\nSources:\n[1] [12tomatoes.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEC0vKMotzpO1bHrPy-HBaMVLgNDHblH5nyjzwVTnz1fXFb8x9NWXCsZRjJto-inElG3f7uV-Jxa6xqsXgkHRaCbuSg1bqVPIr0_tLZZGXKRS43QKZKF_Vkun-OKpbfOEzgTNRvzJQMaAsIVx3ZCcMB_FAzzn5RovPhLclpxsIawldPKqoTVfOZizrA)\n[2] [castironskilletcooking.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEZzS3p_gocwzQUGbBw9f0QPtsJMgLYzU4xN6X_TJVcx1TzXm95UEb8u72SeBlCmNqkRDQJIBUi1ZE8NxSd5LWbfgpt6wWqbt2ICTUkC1Gs52LTuoUggZlBHNVenvltNzuSe9YGfGQH0vBLV6K2jKUhEr3Iq4xmesJ7j0nfjJSO3w==)\n[3] [inquiringchef.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwaXIS__uL4xB8e2yR9VA06FI_bjnhU9HKq_GjVZ2yJiyshe0SdqAhiNW5qZQioncFPISlWOULoD14LeJ78OOI8fAdKR3IpsDBN8ONS7kY0VaDp1mMRp4yEl2tNf1ucGG62H4KqH1hsmRZUaF_nd41)\n[4] [recipetineats.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFptYo2wgLPqw4DDVRG8PRsN-DfLyU4AHeFLM7kP3a2PEwUq77lcUZfdwguNSuj-Boo64s-D2B6DLvgnWUDYSKnwNls6UyVX89yb8QQ7LSzRiI2WVGyiFaERSBvwUCoFrTxZIQ51oYcE3stXDFNYHIvokinHrWfglq6s1Dg3BIENxPRjw==)\n[5] [bellyfull.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvrIvdy2Odqrgkhp2T6UBPRAdmBQ_YDgRJDNabUb7N-7WFwxPF1H7flbPZpFnXTksyyAJafTglCuBtF8D2K0NBCfNxC_a6vr9n2FUUmko3AXHxB5kZViy29o7j9mA28nFLZ1BA)"
