    summary: "While a direct search for \"photo ID\" on Unsplash.com within Google Search did not yield individual Unsplash photo IDs in the search snippets, numerous collections of images related to \"cream cheese\" and \"bun,\" \"garlic bread,\" or \"buns\" were found. These results are often aggregated through stock photo platforms that license Unsplash content.\n\nFor instance, searches for \"cream cheese bun\" and \"cream cheese garlic bread\" led to various image collections. \"932 Cheese Bun Stock Photos\"[1] and \"803 Cream Cheese Bun Stock Photos\"[2] are available, which include images of homemade cream cheese buns. Similarly, \"609 Cheese Garlic Bread Images and Stock Photos\"[3][4] and \"607 Cheesy Garlic Bread Stock Photos\"[5] contain relevant pictures, often featuring \"Korean cream cheese garlic bread.\" Some results also show \"homemade cream cheese buns\" in broader categories like \"cheese rolls\"[6] and \"cheese bread\"[7][8].\n\nWhile specific Unsplash photo IDs were not directly extractable from these Google search results, the links provided in the search snippets point to collections where such images can be browsed. For example, some Getty Images results that appear to feature Unsplash content do provide a \"Creative #\" which is their internal identifier for the image (e.g., 2194437561 for \"Delicious Homemade Buns Pies\"[9] or 1453789387 for \"Veneziane Venetian Sweets With Pastry Cream\"[10]). However, these are Getty Images IDs, not native Unsplash photo IDs.\n\nSources:\n[1] [gettyimages.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGRvparuMVykdWGKae_Z9M8_z3ZgvzPLikv3OYNpmQd8IfFQ9mmN1hqVI9f6xEu31RBWsxSK5r4TUxjPTNXCxf8-ZPPLNIE6doJTtQsJkJSvM54-fLGM_OcLLeMFN8bqxD-LqAG-Vz6KQ==)\n[2] [gettyimages.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHh8bjCp7RaE6dIDc-YSbQ-fh-RzAPmzLtQpgmIW16Fga3SXwIklWfv9NcuzvDBG-2TsP3ojIli4Xn4on6X1dyWKedjfKDN-XXMVS4IxteEZAGi2Z65yB52OsLFbN-Ud4URFUVLqdMbLkTXdrRg7A==)\n[3] [gettyimages.com.au](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErqIdcbvpx5r98sAlSqjyg4i_-RfA8bqiSRlhoN-3_ZW4PfvW9IrpEumM5mPJzk9y12f0iZS8u-sYos3bjhbgRQ5M95dOZGrkaE7nd9rQL3h0CglanKrQlRX2FWBrnhIMnpnSAStYL9H7nWSPqkkqdNNfmmA==)\n[4] [gettyimages.ae](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG-1laUejyydCn4YTf32Lx6o05of3QRlcLCuXWQRZxUxOEUTJETvokJN7sT3aJ3T8vMegeQCKWextTklSbgqUNvxH781_FBucpQLUDJ4lYyGUH5lR5PLCrpkoWlkY6YvMnNYUdJa-HB-EUSvvM5XHTC)\n[5] [gettyimages.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGKL4egXpCLEds_QgqRfLrZmbPiT8xwoXHLVg3YW-znpVJIZ-5UbSOw-_WVw7LYwBz4-MrSFsYw9QWqcay1MCVi5A2uROCLIu9IdQnIh8A2s5VjYBBb_-pgFSNK-FoyVpz-tDbhG2Y2MMsNHSl9Oim9Hw==)\n[6] [gettyimages.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEk1MppNq1jg_qbhW0UJ1NXK7BQ2heuMCD7Y28EdJqLM_K8GgzspO3PJdhta3SHPd9VUPGeucbDdGpb3ancd2OkdqniLXWVjEfF4Wb7SdNpV706LwmoIS7zfvpMjrRKBKrWpwbgnTBKfWUV)\n[7] [gettyimages.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGt6DFgr7hCgPpecE666-e5t3g7M7TTB4n8JIJMG29KBpg6Kmc69nWn6U51QEDbaOQzlJMQTNhCNt3gZYX2-t6q_2FplGuqmTzOY0Ues9KcJspxkZHMQ6HM6h9c_w6RzyedCs-BLzI2NidW)\n[8] [gettyimages.es](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEHVIXuTjAmo4CzHZOh5wym_iQaCeMWsp5fIRY7xjQlFZaCGlVLLmsiqWyItEDvAIjv4GVX8Q46axi-ba0i9X2l2RV8PsbSlwc_nbt1Tf4lP9f_Ewb8Lwq-Xbj1QuJDMQYe9ajYqFqRCQ==)\n[9] [gettyimages.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHLeWUQ40AjqZ0JToBYnLcWcqliQnc-tvNVndVN_IwOM-bJ0sDrHL9vbeCBnpDF-FaVbMpVHvqCvO2MDkXM7HkZJ-8DHoPTg58EaoEw59r2O6hU3MNR1-UPUa_TY70d8VWOeipdQkUS3F705_vyuWI_25ViUelccd1OFaBO7IdxGZcUVp31MVAZT8GBScJHe4hgg9BEP9WDV9FoGzFbVSVzkxXpel0OwMAm)\n[10] [gettyimages.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZNOeBigfxeWnrgVqmGKFmXoHUq5ictBwzBb01auwuidaMLgdMR0TZvtSksOc01IxpFTF7A9jXvb-BrJKbMbX1rAruk6rJWoTYhlHIggExsZVghRU8fZOR1GHCTHN6BsFvw