      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXAtJm-DN2wZHM2ENpC1x2fCQxCISo2aWjGLTYAtZZJrBYoeQAQkv3KWNic3xmGeO0Dcy_apnwLxHt-dKAKQTQ1qoW-ip0CLi8S8JBB2gewdkNVOJ90jbzSSxt7oucv4gaTZxLQP3xMUe3bUsSq9VUSlQrkE_DTE1nGa0SFBkV2xbrmrA="
      title: "unsplash.com"
    }
    summary: "To find images of \"garlic bun\" or \"garlic bread\" on Unsplash, you can directly use the search bar on the Unsplash website. Unsplash is a platform that offers free, high-resolution photographs, and its search function allows users to find images by typing in relevant keywords[1][2][3].\n\nHere\'s how to find images matching your query on Unsplash:\n1.  Navigate to the Unsplash homepage (unsplash.com).\n2.  Use the search bar, typically located in the center of the homepage, to enter your desired keywords[1]. You can search for \"garlic bun,\" \"garlic bread,\" or \"garlic buns\" to find a variety of relevant images.\n3.  The search results will display photos matching your terms. For example, direct searches for \"garlic bread\" already yield numerous results[4][5][6]. Similarly, images for \"garlic naan\" are also available[7].\n\nThe partial URL \"images.unsplash.com/photo-\" you provided is part of Unsplash\'s image URL structure, which is dynamic and used for accessing and manipulating specific images, including resizing and cropping, via their API[8][9][10]. However, to discover images based on keywords, utilizing the website\'s search bar is the most effective method.\n\nSources:\n[1] [cuny.edu](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvgCFqel5waM9kP1_ePUWOPt8ZAiDmGy5EwSqiv44u_A49qlvjqX6_KR7gOeA4UeSVM1qjOal_yUq8FMhvu9E4l75Rfj8qlwXwgi_p6ESVVkRtW58p5sZOqCn70YohX6HzjVIrfknd8kLTxmajG_fq5QMjFbMQ5Nfgc2SbPlJNKLmtzxqkeAlRBbfo3HeQdWoD)\n[2] [writingcooperative.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHnZov4TmesV_Qbis_OuU8lE3p7Axog3j_HR3ibcpEPMC6__vdRZI12Xug_Ie1Ob6ms6XrSY_aNWAQmW2QZ9bz_o_U5tudqBn57oMF9HbfVwVF0y9dZHS92gUxDraxOQROBxsdmIJOA_04wo1nujuNlhQeA1YqDXSK-EzzJXlQKNlZiwWkGgue9QKdeEONcElgnZ6hWXEwpawYByx7BuvE1xJ-6LVrPPSFf)\n[3] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEASANbx66S0N2EobpsfB6-jzoEJsSrgnqUFgpM4YqrteTAg8t0FpC83swJKcY7X8ltmxP519aSNYkjtSRBV