    summary: "I\'ve searched Unsplash.com for images related to \"garlic bread\", \"garlic buns\", \"garlic rolls\", \"korean garlic bread\", \"korean bread\", \"korean buns\", \"cream cheese buns\", \"cheese bread\", \"baked garlic bread\", \"pull apart bread\", and \"sweet garlic bread\" within the `photos` directory.\n\nThe search results show various recipes and descriptions for different types of garlic bread, including:\n\n*   **Korean Cream Cheese Garlic Bread:** This popular dish features soft dinner rolls or Hawaiian rolls stuffed with a sweet cream cheese filling and then dipped in a garlic butter mixture before baking[1][2]. The garlic butter typically includes melted butter, sweetened condensed milk, heavy cream, minced garlic, parsley, egg, and salt[1]. The bread is often cut into wedges or petals to create pockets for the cream cheese filling[1].\n*   **Cheese and Garlic Crack Bread (Pull Apart Bread):** This is a savory pull-apart bread made by cutting a loaf into diamond shapes, filling the cracks with a butter, garlic, salt, and parsley mixture, and then stuffing in cheese before baking[3].\n*   **Garlic Cheese and Herbs Pull-Apart Bread:** Another variation of pull-apart bread, this one uses a homemade dough and is filled with soft butter, dry herbs or pizza seasoning, powdered dehydrated garlic, and grated cheddar cheese before being folded and baked[4].\n*   **Classic Garlic Bread:** This involves cutting bread horizontally, spreading a mixture of softened butter, minced garlic, and salt, and then baking until golden brown. Parmesan cheese and fresh parsley can be added for extra flavor and garnish[5].\n\nWhile the search results primarily provided recipes, the initial query was designed to find images on Unsplash.com. The information retrieved from the search results gives context to the types of \"garlic bread\" and \"buns\" that would likely be found in such image searches.\n\nSources:\n[1] [12tomatoes.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEgYyikfkeEl2zqoHiEpveAEjxItD9wU6IK2ulvlfPmkEZgC_WMX4dM55Lnm7M-kHtwtqM-cfXZp1Kl9YsxgS-1DLouUHG9swYrkXMxtKFF4dP59BXNHcpGI3WPWIoFXc6eQ4K8ukbNBOkxCSpeF6KZiDDW6LWonO8tG5vaPcRoS9zS1KqD5Wse3JTgmw==)\n[2] [castironskilletcooking.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1D0F9_Ac-gi04yftXMBbRnvr7ITQgWB93eIX2EPfeKB-kWMbfJ0gZhdqa5-k4Nd9BzJzLHouA_BOgAQzyUtIUxaqTVPjasREsB5Wn8dzP4qYzLTgIiJjBouVXUnvfJfwZt81860qVDosAl7mxxaVfONpqiPFFMjYqVTw6-kYZpg8=)\n[3] [recipetineats.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGcBV6ZBa5vjyhV8uMUoB01BioVP_gogY2UnMk56Trn3-tg-0zIs-O58P3XDa_QAa9XJOph6bjolF6r8k5uVetJBkWnJ6gXaIM0UOKLTydWSFa8SxawTizPdGmhZBd2OysWWxboTIK2z0vZpRWx4IMDl9cBbX0nxmiHIht4oRJYW5BrGew=)\n[4] [ambrosiasoulfulcooking.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFslMoX9HImU_fkJuyXhPMv_zV5_0pGN_eGlsMmeB_r4N_lmhqztP4RaYYmteyP6a-eWFN6cr1Y_5PGQP5QF1CSmIF5M8Uv0P19yB_s_H2YwRUiLMctLJewwbCo9TW1aax3RlKoDgBRLq4OHfqMknApM89ZvA5hQgzezsA77_KCSnlIG_DkJYvoj2VviIw3ZnM=)\n[5] [twopeasandtheirpod.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHihdVCoB08NTmiihFWg5cbHzwzM4OM4DqPZ-XWqPtAJB1fd_b4oe5F8-ROz3Jy6jvcVqbNrzGNIxLmKYZX905WggFWjUihOC9mYBlZB1apRenD6NRI9Ppk0RF4aP4sMIVgGPTqIcgqCbxhcQ==)"
