    summary: "The search for \"site:unsplash.com/photos \"garlic bread\" OR \"garlic buns\" OR \"korean garlic\"\" did not directly return image results from Unsplash, but rather articles and recipes related to \"Korean cream cheese garlic bread\"[1][2][3][4][5].\n\nThese results indicate that \"Korean cream cheese garlic bread,\" also known as \"Yukjjok Maneul-Ppang\" (\354\234\241\354\252\275 \353\247\210\353\212\230\353\271\265) or \"Cream Cheese Garlic Bread\" (\355\201\254\353\246\274\354\271\230\354\246\210 \352\260\210\353\246\255 \353\270\214\353\240\210\353\223\234), is a popular street food that gained significant attention in Korea around 2019-2020[1][2][3]. It is described as a type of pull-apart bread with a unique sweet and savory flavor profile, featuring a creamy cheese filling and a rich buttery garlic glaze[1][3]. The bread is often cut into a six-sided grid or star pattern to allow the flavors to infuse into every bite and to accommodate the cream cheese filling[1][2][4][5].\n\nIngredients typically include bread flour, milk, eggs, sugar, salt, and butter for the buns, with the filling consisting of cream cheese and additional sugar[2][5]. The garlic butter mixture often contains melted butter, minced garlic, milk, mayonnaise, sugar, parsley, and an egg, giving it a custardy consistency[1][2][4][5]. The buns are usually baked, filled, dipped in the garlic butter mixture, and then baked again for a glossy finish[2][4][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [mykoreankitchen.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQELzmM-YRuea6olzAPjq6ClxSv2j_6C6H-NZ3HAFAogmghFPAi0ItNKdjSDf5ycBcYN2Op8YFBz812NsNBUHN-6khVGZIqZKI7KPqVqMVOxU8KbSANG_tN1qwRcYXE64vwCGgIu1rRjYP3zgwb7DtYsDQ_Fg60UA7A=)\n[2] [bake-street.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFl2oiZfBDnoAArT-1cuf_KYGWYxPYWJM9glB126G1iT-GXmbXgkpbWnHhtci1uwI62PtHjJYGBXc5ZW4UEu55nfYDMckkhk_8Kh4FSCKeKzdJ-f1t9cOJWroTDYncb-z2UbJ13Q39GNUtdgfE7yLE7rFlzSTqqZw==)\n[3] [moribyan.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGSuh3XjbAKO9U1i_HKcCg9SqtZxOmr3Cx077YR4wogf84eNPPOWO7k42pxEl7BthZspSNTdXd81kmEMIUHKH2qOi3u1_hVAVvSa_iVNPU--eXps1H0DlBsfcbzJwDuznngy6vPNWqkl2M55Q==)\n[4] [chainbaker.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfDTMwTGBx4SOPnpBatSlz1_PUAzaAbAEl66tAzkElmHdrH03lL59G-BZr7oX88wDaYpaP8H0xgi3TSZXWOzi1Cvo_aSlIzPYyCAK2kvEqwG-NAlSEQLRzOlf_0uFx1wSZr4hZOKwJLdubRs028ZLOVEO_f0rYthRkN645Pe8=)\n[5] [manilaspoon.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0dgdtTg6owSMuhgwDSPEXsDmLeyWVv5kiku0nKlWr1Wwri9Q12_j0vA7mL9l2V-3K_bPODCyGeAAJ_g3JxF42FKj5khB6KJF9dc6lG6SU3hrWl86pojxHUEN_SLHcHYK89_3KnpIfDy_prVEZ7WVwNUXxPn4_zg==)"
