    summary: "A search on Unsplash.com for \"cream cheese garlic\", \"garlic bread buns\", \"garlic cream cheese bread\", or \"cheese bread buns\" primarily yields results related to Korean Cream Cheese Garlic Bread. This popular dish is a sweet and savory pull-apart bread filled with cream cheese and soaked in a garlic butter mixture before baking[1][2][3].\n\nKey characteristics and ingredients often include:\n*   **Bread Base:** Often uses soft brioche buns or milk bread buns, sometimes prepared from scratch with ingredients like bread flour, milk powder, yeast, and sugar[4][3]. Store-bought dinner rolls are also an option[2].\n*   **Cream Cheese Filling:** Typically a blend of softened cream cheese, sugar, and sometimes heavy cream, whisked until fluffy[1][2][3].\n*   **Garlic Butter Mixture:** This savory component usually consists of melted butter, minced garlic, milk, sugar, egg, and often includes parmesan cheese, dried herbs (like basil or parsley), and a pinch of salt[4][1][2][3]. Some recipes also incorporate condensed milk or mayonnaise for added richness[1][2].\n*   **Preparation:** The buns are typically sliced into sections (often six or eight, without cutting all the way through), filled generously with the cream cheese mixture, and then thoroughly dipped or brushed with the garlic butter custard[4][1][2][3]. They are then baked until golden brown[4][1][2].\n\nThe dish is described as a \"must-try Korean snack\" that gained significant popularity around 2019-2020[1]. It can be served as a side dish, snack, or appetizer[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [mykoreankitchen.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEXMv10eof_NyPazs3qhojk1F5XfjA5AteTgUt7DEcJyvPQjv30Qv3bYWmdI4Iq-sPNRjRSZXQprP0xeO2eoQ5e1ha-4G8c2C8IteIbCFZk4k3D7Eagzs9gZeWJTn0bAeYfL81WzzRbpQV-HdhMw_z6LU_4mD5ykQ==)\n[2] [yejiskitchenstories.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHSwDGuxv4RjGsCmBh_6IBYUeXeFgs4D7rk3qVswHxVO9tB_yZ7Xwyjt7pYZZ5ElOBKpUvybV-NKwvVmWw7CM6LgGj3TpGmL6_aok7sNaU4-q8LMgpuUXRie4AFKvY2fSzDOeEo03Rwg6hoF_24MBputC6FZojtA702_Qs=)\n[3] [food52.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGw4nw0PyzuIGSBgCLzDBzvM0bFYC0bIdcrML_2Dw59LH_ZXULI5RilhxRq9iIybf0mk4lygtV3mnMIg4XX-jgmLKDil4P19zX-xUlQ4kJtTj_QrynHtaQj1cyKYxnisbq7JYyXP-6QSK2-CCc-MAEaUo6AXBzN5WGH9cA=)\n[4] [thezonghan.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHC_dw5lWi1rZuwCXAUCemUZlBVglv-HY9ETeOHxaODeCQ1BwKB7KpBDAEF3tLGCUDiW3B3ee7F9TzEumxjkmhDA1NJFEmGGRVdj0Q5GTXx0C22Gg9cDHtCCbT7cJsmrxt32OTgp7OlzSXYjw==)\n[5] [couponclippingcook.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHB-MRfDkI2s_V4RwxlsiYR8T1PX68nIH7HC-e_4g8BlZJL2JfGK_7J5gVwO-C8hJUeBCcBJ3X2PyV38Zsy36IsMxk3L9nKysf6nP1Y3tLmiAIKsjeEXsCqpKUTAhjrEn5aNMaCD0yZcv_0W3mctxpuRHw6v2EYBw==)"
