  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Website Functionality**\n\nI\'m focusing on features to enhance the website\'s real-world functionality. I\'m exploring various possibilities, such as user interaction elements and e-commerce integrations, to provide a comprehensive list of actionable changes for you to consider. The emphasis is on presenting options, without implementing any modifications until confirmed.\n\n\n**Considering Enhanced Interactivity**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to evaluate options for increased interactivity. I\'m imagining interactive quizzes and dynamic content displays, alongside features like personalized recommendations, and commenting systems. These features aim to make the website more engaging for users and offer a fresh experience.\n\n\n**Defining Real-World Integrations**\n\nI\'m now focusing on specific real-world integrations for a fully functional website. I\'m prioritizing features such as a dynamic shopping cart and checkout, which should also include WhatsApp integration for order placement and messaging. Additionally, I\'m considering using Firebase Firestore, Auth, and custom server routes for key back-end functionality, and Stripe integration for payments. The goal is to make the Belaku Bakes website a fully functional app.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Order Management**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on order management. Specifically, I\'m thinking about integrating email confirmation systems to send receipts and order details directly to customers and bakeries. I\'m also planning to utilize Firestore as the active database, offering Belaku Bakes an easy method to modify the catalog from a simple admin panel.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "To transform your artisanal bakery showcase into a fully functioning, professional real-world web application, we can implement several high-impact features. \n\nHere are the key enhancements we could introduce to make **Belaku Bakes** production-ready, categorized by purpose:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Dynamic Shopping Cart & Checkout Flow\nCurrently, the site lists items with dynamic price estimates. We can build an active ordering pipeline:\n* **Interactive Cart**: Allow users to add cakes, cupcakes, brownies, or warm savouries to a slide-out cart drawer, modify quantities, and calculate totals in real time.\n* **Customization Builders**: Let users choose options directly on the item itself (e.g., selecting **\"Eggless Prep\"**, picking cake sizes from $0.5\\text{ kg}$ to $2\\text{ kg}$, choosing frosting variations, or selecting standard vs. gluten-free).\n\n### 2. Instant Order Channels\nArtisanal bakes are uniquely personal. We can connect actions to real communication channels:\n* **WhatsApp Checkout**: Very standard and effective for boutique bakers. When a user clicks \"Place Order,\" the system automatically compiles their cart, customizations, and address into a pre-filled, beautifully formatted message and redirects them to WhatsApp to finalize the deal with you.\n* **Email Notifications**: Setup server-side endpoints to instantly send an formatted receipt to the user\'s email and a notification copy to your inbox.\n\n### 3. Persistent Database & Admin Catalog (Cloud Persistence)\nInstead of hardcoded data inside code files, we can connect the website to **Firebase Firestore**:\n* **Admin Dashboard**: A secure portal for you to manage the bakery business. You could log in, add weekly special sponge cakes, edit brownie box pricing, or mark any savory item as \"Out of Stock\" dynamically without redeploying any code.\n* **Order Tracker**: An internal board showing \"Pending,\" \"Baking,\" \"Ready for Pickup,\" and \"Delivered\" categories so you can monitor your daily baking pipeline.\n\n### 4. Interactive Custom Cake Planner\nArtisan bakers love bespoke requests. We can implement a structured **Custom-Order Request Form**:\n* Step-by-step picker for custom tier-cakes, flavor notes, and icing choices.\n* Integrated image uploading, enabling clients to securely drag-and-drop reference cakes or design inspirations directly into their consultation sheet.\n\n### 5. Delivery Scheduling Calendar\nCakes take time! We can lock down operational timing:\n* **Date & Slot Picker**: A smart calendar restriction widget that prevents users from choosing same-day delivery for complex items, enforcing a mandatory 24-to-48-hour preparation rule for artisanal cakes, while allowing immediate ordering for ready-made savouries.\n\n---\n\n### How would you like to proceed?\nThese upgrades can be developed incrementally. Simply let me know which of these concepts aligns best with your vision, and I will be happy to step-by-step implement them for you!"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 592475256
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
