  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Nav Label**\n\nOkay, I\'ve decided to update \"Self-Pickup Guide\" in `Navbar.tsx` to \"Kitchen Location.\" This feels much clearer, and still directs the user to the map, so it\'s a good choice. I\'ll get this done promptly!\n\n\n**Designing Pickup Guide**\n\nI\'m working on the `PickupGuide.tsx` component now, aiming for a beautiful map section. I\'ve got the overall layout planned: an elegant container, a title and subtitle (\"Our Kitchen Location,\" \"Hennur, Bengaluru\"), and a premium section with a sidebar (or two-column layout). The sidebar will feature address details, operating hours, and a self-pickup note emphasizing our cloud kitchen model.\n\n\n**Implementing Pickup Map**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating a dynamic Google Maps embed into the `PickupGuide.tsx` component. I\'m focusing on user experience, adding copyable address details with visual feedback and a Google Maps link. The map itself will be prominent, large, and polished for a fantastic display. I\'m also updating mentions of Dunzo to Uber across `Hero.tsx`, `CustomForm.tsx`, and `data.ts`.\n\n\n**Verifying Map Embed**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the Google Maps embed code in `PickupGuide.tsx` is functional and correct. I\'ll maintain that and am planning a responsive layout. The map iframe loads properly with the Hennur Lake location. I\'m proceeding to construct the new content and will ensure the layout is of high quality.\n\n\n**Crafting Location Section**\n\nI\'m now focused on the location section\'s design. I\'m aiming for a prominent, visually appealing presentation. I want to convey our Hennur location with elegance, using a map pin icon, and a catchy header \"Find Our Kitchen in the heart of Hennur.\" I\'m also preparing to integrate the visual elements with the map, and considering the overall flow of the section.\n\n\n**Developing Address Layout**\n\nI\'m now focusing on formatting the kitchen address details for the new location section. I\'m aiming for a clear and concise display within a styled container. I plan to use a bold header for the address, followed by the full address details in a smaller font, and including copy actions for convenience. I am also working on adding the interactive buttons to copy the address information.\n\n\n**Refining Copy Buttons**\n\nI\'ve just added styled copy buttons for the address. I\'ve designed the copy button to update to indicate the successful copy event. I\'m leveraging the `Check` icon to signal success, and the `Copy` icon for an address copy action. I also added a `Google Maps link` for user navigation. The buttons are responsive, and will be integrated into the location address section.\n\n\n**Clarifying Cloud Kitchen Info**\n\nI\'m now revising the \"Cloud Kitchen Info\" section, clarifying our model. I\'ve highlighted \"pure artisanal cloud kitchen\" and emphasized our commitment to cleanliness, premium ingredients, and fresh baking. I\'m also ensuring the messaging accurately represents our delivery approach.\n\n\n**Integrating Delivery Notes**\n\nI\'m now integrating the updated delivery notes, specifying external services like Swiggy Genie or Uber Package with the gate coordinate as our designated pickup point. I\'m focusing on ensuring clarity. I\'m also adding operating hours details, aiming for concise and informative presentation, using a clock icon.\n\n\n**Embedding Map Description**\n\nI\'ve just added a descriptive label to the map. Now, the Hennur Lake location map includes a visual note, positioned at the bottom-right of the iframe, which clarifies its area. This addition will help guide the user visually. The embed is now more informative for the user.\n\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am rewriting the file `src/components/PickupGuide.tsx` to completely replace the delivery guide steps with a section displaying our Hennur kitchen location, an elegant copyable address card, and a massive interactive Google Map."
